Expanded Pocket 3 support: live view, COLOR, portrait/2.7K formats and clip playback. New Direction Lock, gimbal tabs, experimental Motion Control, movable scopes, ND assist and CineStop/IRE/EL Zone false color. Clearer camera joining, diagnostics and gamepad controls. Fixes for reconnects, Nano color, LUT rendering, peaking and face AF. Full beta notes: openpocketcine.app/docs/releases/beta-102/
